nt-body"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="lucide:check"><use href="#ai:lucide:check"></use></svg><span>Capacitación para el personal encargado del monitoreo y control de los equipos.</span></li></ul><a href="/contacto" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark text-white font-heading font-semibold uppercase text-sm px-6 py-3 transition-colors self-start">CONTACTAR A UN ESPECIALISTA<svg width="1em" height="1em" class="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right"><symbol id="ai:lucide:arrow-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14m-7-7l7 7l-7 7"/></symbol><use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use></svg></a></div></article>"
